{"id":"00366","root":"uni00366_1","name":{"ja":"クローンアサギ","en":"Clone Asagi"},"title":{"ja":"【夏祭り】","en":"【Summer Festival】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【夏祭り】 クローンアサギ","en":"【Summer Festival】 Clone Asagi"},"aliases":["Asagi (Clone)"],"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2020-08-14","limited":true,"characterId":147,"profile":{"ja":"元特務機関“Ｇ”のＣＳ＝サイボーグソルジャー。中華連合がアサギの細胞から開発したクローンアサギ、そのほとんどはオリジナルによって抹殺されてしまったが、彼女はその生き残りである。当初はクローンである事を悲観し、死ばかりを望んでいた彼女であるが“Ｇ”に拾われ両手両足をサイボーグ化されたのを契機に本来持つずば抜けた身体能力が開花。同時にオリジナルの持つ“正義感”にも目覚め、やがて“Ｇ”のやり方に疑問を持ち出奔してしまう。現在は追手から逃れつつ闇の町で探偵業を営んでいる。彼女の両腕は“Ｇ”が開発した最新サイボーグアーム。『ネメシス』と呼ばれる。ネメシスは特殊な重力場を発生させる事ができ、クローンアサギはその重力場を操って戦闘する。ネメシスは強力だが、頻繁かつ高度なメンテナンスが必要で、“Ｇ”のもとを離れればすぐに運用出来なくなるはずだったが、ある腕利きの魔科医が彼女に興味を持ち、サポートしているのだという。","en":"(Clone Asagi, she/her) Former CS-Cyborg Soldier of the special agency \"G.\" She is a Clone Asagi—one of the clones the Chinese Union created from Asagi's cells. Most clones were eliminated by the original, but she survived. Initially despairing over her status as a clone and longing for death, she was rescued by \"G\" and had both arms and legs cybernetically enhanced, which unlocked her innate superhuman abilities. Simultaneously, she awakened the original's sense of justice and eventually grew skeptical of \"G,\" defecting. Now she evades pursuers while running a detective agency in the shadowy city. Her arms are \"G's\" latest cybernetic limbs, called \"Nemesis.\" Nemesis can generate a special gravity field, which Clone Asagi manipulates in combat. Though powerful, Nemesis requires frequent, advanced maintenance and would become inoperable once she left \"G,\" but a skilled magical doctor took interest in her and now supports her."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"蒼乃むすび","forms":[{"id":"uni00366_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1416,2832],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[124,248],"def":[154,308],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["5","720004"]},{"